-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Model weights (GitHub Release weights-v1; not in this source tree)
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The authors' trained weights are released under Apache-2.0, subject to upstream terms: the ball
crop fine-tunes derive from the MIT-licensed WASB-SBDT tennis weights (Copyright (c) 2023 NTT
Communications Corporation), and the event model was initialised from torchvision's Kinetics-400
and ImageNet weights, and the view head is built with DINOv3 (DINOv3 License, copy in the
release). The serve-location prior is fitted to the public Hawk-Eye CourtVision trajectory data,
which is not redistributed. See MODEL_CARD.md and THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md in the release.

-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Data
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

physics/bounce_law_hawkeye_holdout.json and physics/bounce_reference.py contain coefficients
fitted to the public Hawk-Eye CourtVision trajectory data (Roland Garros 2019-2021, Australian
Open 2020-2021). That data is not redistributed here. Player heights in
cv/pipeline/player_biometrics.json are public ATP/WTA profile values listed with their URLs.
The images in docs/samples/ are single reduced frames from one broadcast, included only to
illustrate the tool's output.
